
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Rovolox - Welcome</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #10152b;
  color: white;
}
header {
  padding: 22px 8%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  background: #171e39;
}
.logo { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #9585ff; }
nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 20px; }
main { text-align: center; padding: 90px 20px; }
h1 { font-size: 48px; }
p { color: #c5cbe0; font-size: 18px; }
.buttons { margin-top: 30px; }
button {
  border: 0;
  padding: 15px 28px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  background: #705cff;
  color: white;
  font-size: 16px;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin: 6px;
}
.secondary { background: #303b5b; }
.card {
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 35px auto;
  padding: 30px;
  background: #202a49;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; color: #929db9; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">ROVOLOX</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#games">Games</a>
    <a href="#account">Account</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main id="home">
  <h1>WELCOME TO ROVOLOX</h1>
  <p>Your next gaming adventure starts here.</p>
  <div class="buttons">
    <button onclick="location.href='#games'">EXPLORE GAMES</button>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="location.href='#account'">LOGIN</button>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="games">
    <h2>Discover Roblox Games</h2>
    <p>Explore amazing experiences and find your next adventure.</p>
    <button onclick="window.open('https://www.roblox.com/games', '_blank')">
      ▶ PLAY NOW
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="account">
    <h2>Join Rovolox</h2>
    <p>Sign in or create your Roblox account through Roblox.</p>
    <button onclick="window.open('https://www.roblox.com/login', '_blank')">
      LOGIN
    </button>
    <button class="secondary" onclick="window.open('https://www.roblox.com/', '_blank')">
      SIGN UP
    </button>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>ROVOLOX © 2026</footer>
</body>
</html>

